      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a good start. To make the training more impactful for the managers, I want to show them exactly what those internal biases look like in practice. \n\nCould you write out three short \"internal monologue\" snippets for a hiring manager sitting across from these candidates? One for the AAVE speaker, one for the immigrant accent, and one for the Midwestern speaker. I want to capture the specific kinds of \"unprofessional\" or \"less capable\" thoughts a biased manager might have so they can recognize them in themselves.",
